  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 6500K White LED Light Strip Combo Kit contains 6500K White LED Light Strip (1pcs), contains USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors (2pcs), and 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10pcs）. The 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors and the USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors fit the 6500K White LED Light Strip, making it the perfect DIY LED light accessory kit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Solder Point"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Installation Tutorial"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "How to connect your COB LED strip light with this connector"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>6500K White LED Light Strip Combo Kit</strong></span> contains <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> 6500K White LED Light Strip (1pcs)</span></strong></a>, contains<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/3-pin-10mm-led-strip-connector-cable-with-sm-female-plug-for-rgb-copy\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors (2pcs)</span></strong></a>, and <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/2-pin-8mm-l-shaped-led-strip-connectors\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10pcs）.</span></strong></a> The 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors and the USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors fit the 6500K White LED Light Strip, making it the perfect DIY LED light accessory kit.</p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 顶部图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_head-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"> <!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"White LED Light Strip\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/72d1d12609e94182ab214edf567e7929/banner_bf70599d-939a-4ce7-9b2f-98607412d1c9.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"White LED Light Strip\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/72d1d12609e94182ab214edf567e7929/banner_bf70599d-939a-4ce7-9b2f-98607412d1c9.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<strong><!-- table布局 --><!-- 物品清单布局结束 --><!-- 标题加文案 --></strong></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\"><a data-mce-block=\"true\" href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 --></a>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Parameter</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Each pixel can be easily cut or soldered independently without damaging the remaining pixels.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/5b7b8c8728264d0fad45c75b38a6d721/Group_48450.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/5b7b8c8728264d0fad45c75b38a6d721/Group_48450.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Solder Point</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/ed73f8d85daa47d1aef4f2b2327bca18/57dd62090898614acce41420a61a43cb.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/ed73f8d85daa47d1aef4f2b2327bca18/57dd62090898614acce41420a61a43cb.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Installation Tutorial</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">How to connect your COB LED strip light with this connector</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/61facea182e446c49b12627aaf2cf1e9/Frame_1123860832.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/61facea182e446c49b12627aaf2cf1e9/Frame_1123860832.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">In the box</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">6500K White LED Light Strip (1pcs) - KA004</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/3-pin-10mm-led-strip-connector-cable-with-sm-female-plug-for-rgb-copy?utm_source=copyToPasteBoard&amp;utm_medium=product-links&amp;utm_content=web\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm (2PCS) - XC002</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/2-pin-8mm-l-shaped-led-strip-connectors\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">2 Pin 8mm L Shape For White LED (10PCS) - XE002</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The 6500K White LED Light Strip Combo Kit contains 6500K White LED Light Strip (1pcs), contains USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors (2pcs), and 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10pcs）. The 2-pin 8mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors and the USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connectors fit the 6500K White LED Light Strip, making it the perfect DIY LED light accessory kit.\n\nThe LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.\n\nHow to connect your COB LED strip light with this connector",
